# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads to Cloud Build.
#
# Without this file gcloud synthesises one from .gitignore, which is close but
# not guaranteed; being explicit keeps a 314MB node_modules out of every deploy
# rather than relying on that fallback. The image installs its own dependencies
# from the lockfile, so none of it is needed in the build context.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
dist
.env
.env.local
*.log
